{"id":"a437620e31ab5c03","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-provable.md","title":"Definition — 内建直觉主义命题可证性","display":"Definition — 内建直觉主义命题可证性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-provable","aliases":["14-df-provable"],"display":"Definition — 内建直觉主义命题可证性","depends_on":["[[14-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 内建直觉主义命题可证性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e987275dbc75bae6\" href=\"?note=e987275dbc75bae6\" title=\"14-df-formula\">14-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为命题字母集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{bot},\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\">\\(\\mathsf{bot},\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e987275dbc75bae6\" href=\"?note=e987275dbc75bae6\" title=\"14-df-formula\">14-df-formula</a> 中彼此不同的有限元组构造子；命题原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{atm}(p)\">\\(\\mathsf{atm}(p)\\)</span> 另用标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"11\">\\(11\\)</span>。本条的公式均属于下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,a\\wedge b,a\\vee b,a\\to b\">\\(\\bot,a\\wedge b,a\\vee b,a\\to b\\)</span> 是这些构造子的排版记号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\">\\(a,b,c\\)</span> 遍历该公式集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\">\\(\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\)</span> 是本条的命题真式缩写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{atm}(p):=(11,p)\\quad(p\\in P),\\qquad P_0:=\\{\\mathsf{atm}(p)\\mid p\\in P\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{bot}\\},\\qquad P_{n+1}:=P_n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{and}(a,b),\\mathsf{or}(a,b),\\mathsf{imp}(a,b)\\mid a,b\\in P_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{atm}(p):=(11,p)\\quad(p\\in P),\\qquad P_0:=\\{\\mathsf{atm}(p)\\mid p\\in P\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{bot}\\},\\qquad P_{n+1}:=P_n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{and}(a,b),\\mathsf{or}(a,b),\\mathsf{imp}(a,b)\\mid a,b\\in P_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PFml}(P):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}P_n,\\qquad\\neg a:=a\\to\\bot,\\qquad\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}:=\\bot\\to\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PFml}(P):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}P_n,\\qquad\\neg a:=a\\to\\bot,\\qquad\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}:=\\bot\\to\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}(P):=\\{a\\to(b\\to a),\\ (a\\to(b\\to c))\\to((a\\to b)\\to(a\\to c)),\\ (a\\wedge b)\\to a,\\ (a\\wedge b)\\to b,\\ a\\to(b\\to(a\\wedge b)),\\ a\\to(a\\vee b),\\ b\\to(a\\vee b),\\ (a\\to c)\\to((b\\to c)\\to((a\\vee b)\\to c)),\\ \\bot\\to a\\mid a,b,c\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}(P):=\\{a\\to(b\\to a),\\ (a\\to(b\\to c))\\to((a\\to b)\\to(a\\to c)),\\ (a\\wedge b)\\to a,\\ (a\\wedge b)\\to b,\\ a\\to(b\\to(a\\wedge b)),\\ a\\to(a\\vee b),\\ b\\to(a\\vee b),\\ (a\\to c)\\to((b\\to c)\\to((a\\vee b)\\to c)),\\ \\bot\\to a\\mid a,b,c\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}(\\Gamma,\\varphi)\\iff\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\ \\exists d\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)^{\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}}\\ \\left(d(n-1)=\\varphi\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\ \\left(d(i)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}(P)\\vee\\exists j,k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,i-1\\}\\ d(k)=(d(j)\\to d(i))\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}(\\Gamma,\\varphi)\\iff\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\ \\exists d\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)^{\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}}\\ \\left(d(n-1)=\\varphi\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\ \\left(d(i)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}(P)\\vee\\exists j,k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,i-1\\}\\ d(k)=(d(j)\\to d(i))\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限阶段并给出命题语法集合，互异标签确保原子与复合式不会碰撞。九个公理模式和 modus ponens 构成所声明的直觉主义命题演绎；未加入排中律。证明序列的长度和引用行号均有显式自然数范围。</p>\n<p>本定义直接依赖所用的语法构造子；几何演绎另在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f9eae1f4309444c6\" href=\"?note=f9eae1f4309444c6\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction\">14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction</a> 中定义，二者没有构造依赖。命题真式用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\">\\(\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\)</span> 区分于一阶语法的原始真构造子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e987275dbc75bae6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e987275dbc75bae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathcal U$ 为命题字母集。$\\mathsf{bot},\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}$ 使用 [[14-df-formula]] 中彼此不同的有限元组构造子；命题原子 $\\mathsf{atm}(p)$ 另用标签 $11$。本条的公式均属于下式定义的 $\\mathrm{PFml}(P)$；$\\bot,a\\wedge b,a\\vee b,a\\to b$ 是这些构造子的排版记号。$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PFml}(P)$，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)$，$a,b,c$ 遍历该公式集合。$\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}$ 是本条的命题真式缩写。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction","status":"resolved","id":"f9eae1f4309444c6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本定义直接依赖所用的语法构造子；几何演绎另在 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]] 中定义，二者没有构造依赖。命题真式用 $\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}$ 区分于一阶语法的原始真构造子。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{bot},\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{atm}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"11","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PFml}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,a\\wedge b,a\\vee b,a\\to b","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PFml}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{atm}(p):=(11,p)\\quad(p\\in P),\\qquad P_0:=\\{\\mathsf{atm}(p)\\mid p\\in P\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{bot}\\},\\qquad P_{n+1}:=P_n\\cup\\{\\mathsf{and}(a,b),\\mathsf{or}(a,b),\\mathsf{imp}(a,b)\\mid a,b\\in P_n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PFml}(P):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}P_n,\\qquad\\neg a:=a\\to\\bot,\\qquad\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}:=\\bot\\to\\bot.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}(P):=\\{a\\to(b\\to a),\\ (a\\to(b\\to c))\\to((a\\to b)\\to(a\\to c)),\\ (a\\wedge b)\\to a,\\ (a\\wedge b)\\to b,\\ a\\to(b\\to(a\\wedge b)),\\ a\\to(a\\vee b),\\ b\\to(a\\vee b),\\ (a\\to c)\\to((b\\to c)\\to((a\\vee b)\\to c)),\\ \\bot\\to a\\mid a,b,c\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}(\\Gamma,\\varphi)\\iff\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\ \\exists d\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)^{\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}}\\ \\left(d(n-1)=\\varphi\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\ \\left(d(i)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}(P)\\vee\\exists j,k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,i-1\\}\\ d(k)=(d(j)\\to d(i))\\right)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}","display":false}],"bytes":2230,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-provable|Definition — 内建直觉主义命题可证性]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-provable]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-220","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-provable|Definition — 内建直觉主义命题可证性]]"},{"id":"89152b1252304fa8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathcal U$ 为命题字母集，$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$；$v:\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)$ 为赋值，命题字母上的限制任意，并满足 $v(\\bot)=\\bot_X$ 及对所有 $a,b\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)$ 有 $v(a\\wedge b)=v(a)\\wedge_Xv(b)$、$v(a\\vee b)=v(a)\\vee_Xv(b)$、$v(a\\to b)=v(a)\\Rightarrow_Xv(b)$；公式语法见 [[14-df-provable]]。"}],"outgoing":["e987275dbc75bae6","f9eae1f4309444c6"]}